<title>USA: Pulte Corp Q1 continuing oper shr down.</title>
<headline>Pulte Corp Q1 continuing oper shr down.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD, Mich. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>Oper shr		   $0.05		    $0.19</p>
<p>Oper net		   1,234		    5,108</p>
<p>Revs		     431,700		  432,519</p>
<p>Avg shrs		  23,467		   27,250</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 income from continuing operations before $1.0 million or $0.04 a share income from discontinued operations. Q1 1996 results before $2.0 million or $0.07 a share income from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net income $2.2 million or $0.09 a share vs $7.1 million or $0.26 a share.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 results after gain on sales of collateral at Pulte Financial Cos Inc of $2.7 million or $0.10 a share. No such gains occurred in 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
